 qml6-module-org-kde-plasma-plasma5support
Description: video wallpaper and lock screen for Plasma 6 (org.kde.video)
 Plays a video, or a playlist of videos in order or shuffled, as the desktop's
 wallpaper and as the lock screen's background. Choose "Video" in the
 wallpaper settings of the desktop or in Screen Locking's appearance; each
 keeps its own choice.
 .
 By Jeromy Streets and contributors; this is his Plasma 6 port, unchanged.
